[statement]
An installed package whose version an installed dependent does not admit is
replaced by one it does, whatever the request: `lib` 1.0 becomes 2.0, for
`a`'s `lib>=2`.

[repository]
P:lib
V:2.0-r0

P:b
V:1.0-r0

[installed]
P:a
V:1.0-r0
D:lib>=2

P:lib
V:1.0-r0

[world]
a

[request]
b

[answer apk-tools 3.0.9-r0]
upgrade lib 1.0-r0 2.0-r0
install b 1.0-r0
